---
<BaseLayout title="About" description="Learn about Soto Websites and its practical approach to helping local businesses grow online.">
<section class="section bg-white"><div class="container max-w-4xl"><p class="eyebrow mb-3">About</p><h1 class="h1">Local business websites should be clear, fast, and built to earn trust.</h1><p class="lead mt-6">Soto Websites helps small businesses improve how they show up online. The goal is simple: make your business look credible, explain your services clearly, and make it easy for customers to contact you.</p><p class="lead mt-4">This is not design for design’s sake. Every page, section, form, and call to action should support real business outcomes.</p></div></section><CTA /></BaseLayout>
